              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amukombele bami abaabo boonse bali mubwami, kuti buumi bwesu bube bwaluumuno akutontola, tukale kabotu akulemeka Leza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
